Cell["6. Visualising the distortion itself", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3868b714-b63c-466d-b559-0363ac854609"],

Cell["\<\
A clean way to see the geometry of the transformation is to overlay a regular \
15\[Degree] lat/lon grid on both panels. On the left the grid is undistorted; \
on the right the 325 grid intersections are pushed into the cartogram by the \
same velocity field that reshaped the countries. The grid therefore encodes \
the local stretching/compression factor at every point of the domain.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4fe642c1-5575-45b2-a458-a6bb25bd765c"],

